{"pages":[{"segs":[["Chicago agreement:",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,550.37999999999988,116.00059999999996,80,false],["unity in mission",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,475.49999999999989,176.00059999999996,80,false],["2010 trail west update",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,389.3599999999999,194.10059999999999,20,false],["6. We affirm the leadership commitments students",369.20299999999997,224.84969999999987,561.03800000000001,237.25169999999991,9,false],["and faculty have made to each other’s ministries and",369.20299999999997,237.84569999999985,567.52700000000004,250.2476999999999,9,false],["will not actively recruit them away from those groups.",369.20299999999997,250.84169999999983,573.21500000000003,263.24369999999988,9,false],["When starting a new campus work, each organization",369.20299999999997,263.83769999999981,572.11700000000019,276.23969999999986,9,false],["will endeavor to select new leaders, not leaders from",369.20299999999997,276.83369999999991,567.10400000000004,289.23569999999989,9,false],["other ministries.",369.20299999999997,289.82969999999989,432.93199999999996,302.23169999999988,9,false],["7. We recognize students and faculty have the freedom",369.20299999999997,315.83069999999987,574.23199999999997,328.23269999999985,9,false],["to choose their involvement with any campus",369.20299999999997,328.82669999999985,541.01300000000003,341.22869999999983,9,false],["ministry. In general, we will encourage them to select",369.20299999999997,341.82269999999983,570.54200000000014,354.22469999999981,9,false],["and be involved with one primary organization.",369.20299999999997,354.81869999999981,547.98800000000006,367.22069999999979,9,false],["As ministries committed to the Gospel of Jesus Christ",145.40000000000001,350.52969999999999,350.34800000000013,362.93169999999998,9,false],["and united in his mission on college campuses, the",145.40000000000001,363.52569999999997,335.95700000000005,375.92769999999996,9,false],["following groups listed below met on October 25, 2010",145.40000000000001,376.52169999999995,350.53700000000015,388.92369999999994,9,false],["and agreed to teach the staff, volunteers, faculty and",145.40000000000001,389.51769999999993,341.3300000000001,401.91969999999992,9,false],["student leadership of our organizations the following",145.40000000000001,402.51369999999991,346.33400000000006,414.9156999999999,9,false],["principles about relationships with other Christian",145.40000000000001,415.5096999999999,339.65600000000006,427.91169999999988,9,false],["groups. (John 13: 34 & 35)i",145.40000000000001,428.50569999999988,244.97848200000001,442.73462499999999,9,false],["8. We will encourage collaborative efforts on a",369.20299999999997,380.81969999999978,543.00200000000007,393.22169999999977,9,false],["voluntary basis between our organizations. We are",369.20299999999997,393.81569999999977,560.34500000000003,406.21769999999975,9,false],["open to share experiences and resources to assist each",369.20299999999997,406.81169999999975,574.70900000000006,419.21369999999973,9,false],["other with the unique challenges of campus ministry.",369.20299999999997,419.80769999999973,570.28100000000006,432.20969999999971,9,false],["1. We are all part of Christ’s body.",145.40000000000001,454.52969999999999,270.35599999999999,466.93169999999998,9,false],["2. We do not regard any campus as our exclusive field.",145.40000000000001,480.53069999999997,347.31500000000005,492.93269999999995,9,false],["We recognize that many students and faculty may be",145.40000000000001,493.52669999999995,344.30000000000007,505.92869999999994,9,false],["helped through the various appeals and styles of the",145.40000000000001,506.52269999999993,341.10500000000008,518.92469999999992,9,false],["different organizations.",145.40000000000001,519.51869999999985,234.59899999999999,531.9206999999999,9,false],["C H I C AG O",43.841200000000001,568.30200000000002,57.071200000000005,605.101,7,false],["AG R E E M E N T 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,565.327,9,false],["3. We will seek to establish relationships and build",145.40000000000001,545.51969999999983,336.12800000000004,557.92169999999987,9,false],["bridges with our counterparts in other Christian",145.40000000000001,558.51569999999992,329.07200000000012,570.91769999999997,9,false],["groups on campus. When establishing ministries",145.40000000000001,571.51169999999991,330.32300000000009,583.91369999999995,9,false],["on new campuses, we will take the initiative to",145.40000000000001,584.50769999999989,321.06200000000013,596.90969999999993,9,false],["communicate with the leadership of existing groups.",145.40000000000001,597.50369999999998,343.94900000000007,609.90569999999991,9,false],["4. We will speak well of and refrain from criticism of",145.40000000000001,623.50469999999996,343.40900000000011,635.9067,9,false],["each other’s ministries and members.",145.40000000000001,636.50069999999994,287.51900000000006,648.90269999999998,9,false],["5. We commit to addressing problems on a local,",145.40000000000001,662.50170000000003,326.78600000000006,674.90369999999996,9,false],["regional or national level by humbly communicating",145.40000000000001,675.4976999999999,343.27400000000011,687.89969999999994,9,false],["with our counterparts, seeking the Lord together to",145.40000000000001,688.49369999999999,339.16100000000006,700.89569999999992,9,false],["resolve the issues.",145.40000000000001,701.48969999999997,213.989,713.8916999999999,9,false],["i Our work was built on the Trail West Agreement of",369.20000000000005,653.9434,554.34649999999988,666.12940000000003,9,false],["1971, in which leaders from several campus ministries",369.19850000000002,666.93939999999998,564.03050000000007,679.12540000000001,9,false],["met to develop a practical means of settling conflicts",369.19850000000002,679.93539999999996,555.54349999999999,692.12139999999999,9,false],["between local leaders on a number of campuses across the",369.19850000000002,692.93139999999994,574.57850000000008,705.11739999999998,9,false],["country.",369.19850000000002,705.92739999999992,399.66350000000011,718.11339999999996,9,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792},{"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["C H I C AG O",43.841200000000001,569.09400000000005,57.071200000000005,605.89300000000003,7,false],["AG R E E M E N T 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,566.11900000000003,9,false],["FounDing ministries",146.40000000000001,35.460100000000011,248.72000000000003,56.000099999999975,20,false],["Asian American Christian Fellowship",146.40000000000001,68.075099999999907,290.11200000000008,80.47709999999995,9,false],["Melanie Mar Chow",146.40000000000001,81.071099999999888,219.88500000000002,93.473099999999931,9,false],["Evelyn Fan",146.40000000000001,94.067099999999868,189.13200000000001,106.46909999999991,9,false],["Baptist Collegiate Ministry",146.40000000000001,120.06809999999984,249.99000000000001,132.47009999999989,9,false],["John Moore",146.40000000000001,133.06409999999983,192.86700000000002,145.46609999999987,9,false],["Ken Owens",146.40000000000001,146.06009999999981,189.96899999999999,158.46209999999985,9,false],["Campus Ambassadors",146.40000000000001,172.06109999999978,231.18899999999996,184.46309999999983,9,false],["Valorie Nordbye",146.40000000000001,185.05709999999976,208.887,197.45909999999981,9,false],["Ryan Miller",146.40000000000001,198.05309999999974,191.96700000000001,210.45509999999979,9,false],["Campus Crusade for Christ",146.40000000000001,224.05409999999972,250.43100000000001,236.45609999999976,9,false],["Mark Gauthier",146.40000000000001,237.0500999999997,203.46000000000001,249.45209999999975,9,false],["Keith Davy",146.40000000000001,250.04609999999968,188.691,262.44809999999973,9,false],["Campus Outreach",146.40000000000001,276.04709999999977,215.529,288.44909999999976,9,false],["Kent Bailey",146.40000000000001,289.04309999999975,190.59900000000005,301.44509999999974,9,false